        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-20261107-d7e179628a0b",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Explore the history of Cartagena de Indias on a sightseeing tour in a comfortable vehicle.\nWith a professional bilingual guide, take in panoramic views of Cartagena Bay and see the Pegasus Pier, the Clock Tower, the Moorish and Republican-era architecture of the Manga neighbourhood, and San Felipe de Barajas Fortress.\nWalk through the walled historic centre, with time to shop for souvenirs and explore its streets and squares. Stops include San Pedro Claver Church and the Santo Domingo Bastion.\nReturn to your hotel.\nDuration: 4 hours.\n\nThe tour is led by an English-speaking guide."
    },
